  "method": "Binary STL: uint32 triangle count at byte 80; require 84 + 50*N bytes; read little-endian float coordinates from each record; deduplicate exact coordinate tuples in first-occurrence order; count sorted undirected triangle edges; check exact-zero cross-product area and nonfinite coordinates. Compare MD5 with Zenodo metadata; record SHA256.",
  "limitations": [
    "Structural checks only; no clinical or rendered inspection",
    "STL does not declare physical units",
    "Edges with at most two incident faces do not establish a fully manifold surface",
    "No self-intersection, anatomical correspondence, tissue thickness or motion calibration check",
    "MD5 compared for source transfer consistency; SHA256 recorded for provenance",
    "No graph-isomorphism or material-point correspondence verification; earlier ordering-dependent connectivity digests are not topology proofs"
  ],
